    <div>
      <p begin="00:05.940" end="00:08.880" ttm:agent="v1">Mmhm</p>
      <p begin="00:08.880" end="00:11.150" ttm:agent="v1">Woah</p>
      <p begin="00:11.150" end="00:12.830" ttm:agent="v1">Huh</p>
      <p begin="00:12.830" end="00:14.330" ttm:agent="v1">One take</p>
      <p begin="00:13.730" end="00:16.280" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:16.280" end="00:17.850" ttm:agent="v1">Cop car kind of trailing behind us</p>
      <p begin="00:17.850" end="00:19.650" ttm:agent="v1">Drag race home like I'm failing my license</p>
      <p begin="00:19.650" end="00:21.570" ttm:agent="v1">We on radio silence as I'm playing with fire</p>
      <p begin="00:21.570" end="00:23.420" ttm:agent="v1">Got a call from my boss, nah say I'm retired</p>
      <p begin="00:23.420" end="00:24.920" ttm:agent="v1">Say I'm</p>
      <p begin="00:24.010" end="00:25.510" ttm:agent="v1">In a better place, better than ever</p>
      <p begin="00:25.310" end="00:27.440" ttm:agent="v1">Not dead, not alive, not under the weather</p>
      <p begin="00:27.440" end="00:29.260" ttm:agent="v1">Not at home with you just chasing a high</p>
      <p begin="00:29.260" end="00:32.220" ttm:agent="v1">'Til my answering machine starts saying I'm fired whatever</p>
      <p begin="00:32.220" end="00:33.720" ttm:agent="v1">Back laying in the park</p>
      <p begin="00:33.720" end="00:35.630" ttm:agent="v1">Knee-deep and I'm playing with the sharks</p>
      <p begin="00:35.630" end="00:37.620" ttm:agent="v1">She leave and I'm paying with my heart but</p>
      <p begin="00:37.620" end="00:39.570" ttm:agent="v1">We always staying for the part where we</p>
      <p begin="00:39.570" end="00:41.070" ttm:agent="v1">Tiptoe 'round city limits</p>
      <p begin="00:41.020" end="00:42.930" ttm:agent="v1">And my sixth sense telling me I can't prevent it</p>
      <p begin="00:42.930" end="00:44.930" ttm:agent="v1">She independent and I'm independent</p>
      <p begin="00:44.930" end="00:49.060" ttm:agent="v1">But she show me what can happen in sixty minutes, woah</p>
      <p begin="00:49.060" end="00:55.680" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:55.680" end="00:57.350" ttm:agent="v1">Sixty minutes</p>
      <p begin="00:57.350" end="00:59.590" ttm:agent="v1">Six-six-sixty minutes</p>
      <p begin="00:59.590" end="01:01.640" ttm:agent="v1">Six-sixty minutes</p>
      <p begin="01:01.640" end="01:03.140" ttm:agent="v1">Sixty minutes woah</p>
      <p begin="01:03.090" end="01:05.570" ttm:agent="v1">In a better place, better than ever</p>
      <p begin="01:05.570" end="01:10.280" ttm:agent="v1">Long days in the middle of September, December</p>
      <p begin="01:10.280" end="01:12.580" ttm:agent="v1">Whatever</p>
      <p begin="01:12.580" end="01:18.680" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:18.680" end="01:20.600" ttm:agent="v1">Cop car kind of trailing</p>
      <p begin="01:20.600" end="01:22.330" ttm:agent="v1">Unidentified ailments</p>
      <p begin="01:22.330" end="01:23.830" ttm:agent="v1">I saw you at the Day's Inn</p>
      <p begin="01:23.770" end="01:26.460" ttm:agent="v1">Shit halfway almost famous still</p>
      <p begin="01:26.460" end="01:27.960" ttm:agent="v1">In a better place, better than ever</p>
      <p begin="01:27.960" end="01:29.810" ttm:agent="v1">Not dead, not alive, not under the weather</p>
      <p begin="01:29.810" end="01:31.840" ttm:agent="v1">Long days in the middle of September, December</p>
      <p begin="01:31.840" end="01:34.220" ttm:agent="v1">Birthday suit, birthday sex etcetera, 'cetera 'cause it's</p>
      <p begin="01:34.220" end="01:36.170" ttm:agent="v1">Braille in the dark laying in the park, uh</p>
      <p begin="01:36.170" end="01:38.110" ttm:agent="v1">Knee-deep and I'm playing with the sharks, uh</p>
      <p begin="01:38.110" end="01:40.050" ttm:agent="v1">She leave and I'm paying with my heart but</p>
      <p begin="01:40.050" end="01:42.080" ttm:agent="v1">We always staying for the part</p>
      <p begin="01:42.080" end="01:43.730" ttm:agent="v1">Down the road like several cycles</p>
      <p begin="01:43.730" end="01:45.890" ttm:agent="v1">Earth around the sun and the moon with the tidal makin'</p>
      <p begin="01:45.890" end="01:47.390" ttm:agent="v1">Noises like scratching a vinyl</p>
      <p begin="01:47.350" end="01:49.260" ttm:agent="v1">When the sun sets on our hotel room with the bible</p>
      <p begin="01:49.260" end="01:50.760" ttm:agent="v1">Son of a gun</p>
      <p begin="01:50.510" end="01:52.010" ttm:agent="v1">Woah</p>
      <p begin="01:51.680" end="01:53.770" ttm:agent="v1">Same place with the same courts got</p>
      <p begin="01:53.770" end="01:55.790" ttm:agent="v1">Red lights in the racecourse</p>
      <p begin="01:55.790" end="01:58.110" ttm:agent="v1">Good luck trying to get what you came for yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:58.110" end="01:59.610" ttm:agent="v1">Pillow talk when we're off the spinach</p>
      <p begin="01:59.500" end="02:01.020" ttm:agent="v1">Thoughts diminish hard to finish</p>
      <p begin="02:01.020" end="02:03.190" ttm:agent="v1">Roll over to my phone, check the clock, what is it</p>
      <p begin="02:03.190" end="02:07.410" ttm:agent="v1">My alarm goes off in 60 minutes fuck</p>
      <p begin="02:07.410" end="02:13.870" ttm:agent="v1"/>
